# c opens a one-line prompt titled with the focused task at the bottom; Enter adds the comment, which the attachments panel lists, and Esc on a second prompt adds nothing.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Call the bank
END
keys j c
see ┌ Comment on Call the bank
type Called back
keys <Enter>
hide ┌ Comment on
see Comment added
keys c
type Ignored
keys <Esc>
hide ┌ Comment on
keys \
see Called back
hide Ignored
keys <Esc> z
quit
saved <<END
Errands:
	- Call the bank
END
